<title>USA: MicroTouch says knows no reason for decline.</title>
<headline>MicroTouch says knows no reason for decline.</headline>
<dateline>METHUEN, Mass. 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>MicroTouch Systems Inc said Friday it is not aware of any corporate developments that account for its stock price decline over the last few days.</p>
<p>The company also said its preliminary estimate of earnings for its first quarter is in line with analysts' general expectations. Its first quarter ended March 31.</p>
<p>Final financial results for the quarter are expected to be announced on or about April 28, 1997.</p>
<p>The company's stock rose 3/4 to 18-3/4 in early morning trading.</p>
